{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is visible, approach, pick up, move to holder, put, check properties. Move randomly otherwise.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectHolder    /> <Action ID = PutObjectInHolder    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
